--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Machine learning models
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No model weights are distributed with this software. Models are downloaded on
first use into a local cache directory, and each remains under its own license:

  onnxcrepe (pitch tracking)       MIT     github.com/yqzhishen/onnxcrepe
  basic-pitch (note transcription) Apache-2.0  github.com/spotify/basic-pitch
  whisper.cpp GGML models          MIT     huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp

No model is downloaded yet; the list records what has been chosen so far, and a
row is added when a stage that fetches one lands.

Models under non-commercial terms (CC BY-NC-SA), including the madmom
pretrained models and the Open-Unmix "umxl" weights, are deliberately NOT used.
Nor are models whose weights carry terms narrower than their code. Demucs is the
example: its code is MIT and its author states that the weights are provided for
scientific purposes only, whatever licence a third-party re-upload is tagged
with. Which model separates stems is decided by #312.

